{"title": "Ring of Free Action", "pageid": 10409, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Ring_of_Free_Action", "categories": ["Bugs", "Rings", "Rare items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"> \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-rare\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Ring_of_Free_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d9/Ring_of_Free_Action_Icon.png/300px-Ring_of_Free_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/d/d9/Ring_of_Free_Action_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Ring of Free Action image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d9/Ring_of_Free_Action_Icon.png/300px-Ring_of_Free_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d9/Ring_of_Free_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #01BFFF ;\">Ring of Free Action</span></a> is a rare <a href=\"/wiki/Rings\" title=\"Rings\">Ring</a> which allows the wearer to ignore the effects of <a href=\"/wiki/Difficult_Terrain\" title=\"Difficult Terrain\">Difficult Terrain</a> and confers immunity to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Paralysed_(Condition)\" title=\"Paralysed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/09/Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/09/Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/09/Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Paralysis\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/09/Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/09/Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Paralysed_(Condition)\" title=\"Paralysed (Condition)\">Paralysis</a> and being <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Restrained_(Condition)\" title=\"Restrained (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/20/Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/20/Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/20/Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Restrained\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/20/Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/20/Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Restrained_(Condition)\" title=\"Restrained (Condition)\">Restrained</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>The heart of the gem seems to flow like liquid - yet it contains neither quicksilver nor mercury.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\" style=\"margin-left: 7px\"> \n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rings\" title=\"Rings\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Rings_Icon.png/25px-Rings_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c4/Rings_Icon.png/38px-Rings_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c4/Rings_Icon.png/50px-Rings_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Rings\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Rings_Icon.png/25px-Rings_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c4/Rings_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Rings\" title=\"Rings\">Rings</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Rare\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #01BFFF ;\">Rare</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.05 kg (0.1 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.05 kg (0.1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 160 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  160  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_PHB_OfFreeAction_Ring</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_PHB_OfFreeAction_Ring\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_PHB_OfFreeAction_Ring\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">50379f58-7892-44cb-be6e-146a60070055</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:50379f58-7892-44cb-be6e-146a60070055\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:50379f58-7892-44cb-be6e-146a60070055\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_PHB_OfFreeAction_Ring</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_PHB_OfFreeAction_Ring+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_PHB_OfFreeAction_Ring+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\">Special</span></h3>\n<p>The wearer of this item gains:\n\n</p>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Unwavering\" title=\"Unwavering\">Unwavering</a></dt><dd>You ignore the effects of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Difficult_Terrain_(Condition)\" title=\"Difficult Terrain (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Difficult Terrain\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Difficult_Terrain_(Condition)\" title=\"Difficult Terrain (Condition)\">Difficult Terrain</a>, and cannot be <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Paralysed_(Condition)\" title=\"Paralysed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/09/Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/09/Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/09/Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Paralysed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/09/Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/09/Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Paralysed_(Condition)\" title=\"Paralysed (Condition)\">Paralysed</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Restrained_(Condition)\" title=\"Restrained (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/20/Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/20/Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/20/Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Restrained\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/20/Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/20/Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Restrained_(Condition)\" title=\"Restrained (Condition)\">Restrained</a>.</dd></dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Moonrise_Towers\" title=\"Moonrise Towers\">Moonrise Towers</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-128&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-193</span>: Sold by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Araj_Oblodra\" title=\"Araj Oblodra\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png/25px-Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png/38px-Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png/50px-Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Araj Oblodra\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png/25px-Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3f/Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Araj_Oblodra\" title=\"Araj Oblodra\">Araj Oblodra</a> on the main floor</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City\" title=\"Lower City\">Lower City</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-92&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-78</span>: Sold by Araj Oblodra in <a href=\"/wiki/Crimson_Draughts\" title=\"Crimson Draughts\">Crimson Draughts</a> if not acquired from her in Act Two</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n\n<p><i>Regarding Unwavering:</i></p>\n<ul><li>This passive grants immunity to the following conditions:\n<ul><li>All conditions in the <span class=\"bg3wiki-condition-type\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/40px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Paralyzed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Paralyzed_(status_group)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Paralyzed (status group)\">Paralyzed</a></span> status group</li>\n<li>All conditions in the <span class=\"bg3wiki-condition-type\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/40px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Restrained\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a h